// Item #9 (2026-09-18): "Clicking exit brings you to home." Now that there's a real Home landing
// page (2026-09-20 rewrite — see renderHome), Exit goes there via the normal tab system instead
// of re-showing the login/entrance overlay (that overlay is a one-per-session login gate now, not
